  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e3d25ddaf4fef1e",
      "translationZh": "在 RTX 2060 6GB + 32GB DDR4 RAM 上，使用 llama.cpp 运行 HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive Q4_K_M，预填充速度约为 600 tok/s，解码速度为 23 tok/s，上下文窗口为 131k，使用 Q8 KV cache。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b03be0f07784ac60",
      "translationZh": "在空的 KV cache 上，速度从约 600 tok/s 预填充 / 23 tok/s 解码开始。随着上下文增长，速度会趋于稳定——在约 90k 上下文时，稳定在大约 485 tok/s 预填充和 15 tok/s 解码，并保持在这一水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0a76a3822f78512",
      "translationZh": "视觉投影器运行在 CPU 上（--no-mmproj-offload），这使显存使用量保持在约 5.2 GB 以下，并避免 OOM / GPU 崩溃。图像编码在 CPU 上会更慢，但可以节省约 1GB 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bd23836ab0d530f",
      "translationZh": "大多数 MoE 专家层也运行在 CPU 上（--n-cpu-moe 39），这正是 35B 模型能够装入 6GB 显存的根本原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbfab46a49e986b4",
      "translationZh": "硬件：RTX 2060 6GB + 32GB DDR4 RAM + i5-10400F CPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7b0a011e1706b38",
      "translationZh": "上下文：131072 个词元，Q8_0 KV 缓存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f35702660a79bf8",
      "translationZh": "希望这能帮到一些人。如果有人有让启动命令更完善的技巧，欢迎在评论区留言——我已经想不出别的点子了 :D",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
